{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20267JkjIpRc591795132516.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>服裝品牌集團Gap第三季度業績略好過市場預期，但下調全年度業績指引。</p><p></p><p>公司季內賺3.11億美元，按年增長三成一。經調整每股攤薄盈利82美仙，較預期多4美仙。淨收入逾40億美元，則與預期相若。</p><p></p><p>集團下調全年度業績指引，當中經調整每股攤薄盈利，由原預期2.35至2.45美元，下調至2.29至2.34美元，淨收入由預期增長百分之1至1.5，降至持平。經調整毛利率由預期輕微上升，降至輕微下跌。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T00:43:53.446272+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":194,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T23:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T09:09:35.532131+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T00:37:17.128523+00:00","content_hash":"640344d2b5602734c9cb6fdc142d27ee30f813eb4d01112ff3c568cbbaa14b02","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T00:43:53.446272+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}